ext-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 天命之子的暴击机制不同于普通的<span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 28px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">MMORPG游戏机制，<span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">无论上阵多少天子，一次的暴击状态只能由一位天子触发，并且当达到一定时限后，暴击状态会消失，此时出手不会触发暴击</span>，因此，如韩服雷萍【鲁邦】具有的暴击抑制，虽然是抑制除刀以外的天子暴击率，却属于增益buff。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">2.暴击公式</span></p></div><br></span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">公式由楼主本人使用了泡面和不同进化星级下的天子，调整不同数值，进行了上百次的独立重复测试验证，</span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"></div><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; font-weight: 700;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\">暴击公式：<br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">（面板暴击×<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">0.01</span></span>）<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">×</span></span></span></span></span></span>（0.1<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">×</span></span>进化星级）+buff=实际暴击率【5-6星】</span></span></span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">（面板暴击<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">×</span></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">0.01</span></span>）+buff=实际暴击率【1-4星】</span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px;\">ps：注意，<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">1-4星天子通过进化</span></span></span>升到5<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">-6</span></span>星后套用的是第一条公式。进化星级指的是天子当前星级，例<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">如<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">三星达比进化到六星，它的<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">初始星级是3，</span></span>进化星级是6</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">3.尾言</span></p></div><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 需要注意的是，</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;\">只有ts和ss技能才能触发暴击，普通攻击和ds技能都不会触发暴击。并且天子是拥有</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;\">暴击防御的</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">（其等同于额外增伤，只不过为负值）</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;\">，当暴击防御高到一定程度，</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;\">暴击数值可能还没有不暴